# TEMPLATE FOR REFERENCE ONLY -- do not `cp` this over /etc/ishtar-app.env.
#
# /etc/ishtar-app.env already exists on the VPS: mode 600, root-owned, and
# already holds a working RESEND_API_KEY and DJANGO_FROM_EMAIL, verified
# end-to-end with a real delivered send (docs/deployment.md, "Resend
# transactional email"). Overwriting, truncating or regenerating that file
# destroys a working sending key and breaks live email. deploy-app.sh only
# ever reads /etc/ishtar-app.env (to source it, and to check -- never
# change -- that it isn't group- or world-readable); it never writes its
# content and never chowns or chmods it, so re-running the deploy can never
# clobber or loosen it.
#
# When deploying this service, APPEND the lines below that are not already
# present. Do not touch the two that already exist unless they are actually
# wrong -- do not regenerate them from this file.
#
# Already present, shown here only for reference (do not re-add):
#   RESEND_API_KEY=re_...                                          (sending-only key, scoped to ishtarinsights.com)
#   DJANGO_FROM_EMAIL="Ishtar Insights <hello@ishtarinsights.com>"
#
# File must stay mode 600 (or stricter), root-owned. deploy-app.sh never
# chmods or chowns this file -- it asserts on every run that the file is not
# group- or world-readable and refuses to deploy, with a clear message, if
# it is; fix permissions by hand (chmod 600) and re-run rather than relying
# on the deploy to correct them. Quote any value containing spaces -- this
# file is both sourced by POSIX sh (deploy-app.sh's `set -a; .
# /etc/ishtar-app.env; set +a`) and read by systemd's EnvironmentFile=, and
# only quoting satisfies both readers; DJANGO_FROM_EMAIL above is the
# example of why (unquoted, the shell would split it into several words at
# the first space and sourcing would break).
#
# Generate the secret key with:
#   python3 -c "import secrets;print(secrets.token_urlsafe(50))"
DJANGO_SECRET_KEY=replace-me
DJANGO_ALLOWED_HOSTS=ishtarinsights.com,www.ishtarinsights.com
DJANGO_CSRF_TRUSTED_ORIGINS=https://ishtarinsights.com,https://www.ishtarinsights.com
NEWSLETTER_ORIGINS=https://ishtarinsights.com,https://www.ishtarinsights.com
